        "detailed_description": "<h1>💚💚 MORE UPCOMING GAMES! 💚💚</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/bc7f6cd22ff892eb657e4efc6fbbac28.poster.avif?t=1787941221\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/bc7f6cd22ff892eb657e4efc6fbbac28.webm?t=1787941221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/bc7f6cd22ff892eb657e4efc6fbbac28.mp4?t=1787941221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/9bb63dae48437d8fbd64044f95db9261.poster.avif?t=1787941221\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/9bb63dae48437d8fbd64044f95db9261.webm?t=1787941221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/9bb63dae48437d8fbd64044f95db9261.mp4?t=1787941221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, welcome back to our experimental hidden cat project! Cats Around Us is a series that blends heartwarming silent comics with hidden cat gameplay.<br><br>The second installment in the series is called Black Cat.<br><br>Created by Apit No Baka, Black Cat is a five-page silent comic that tells the touching story of a man and his elusive black cat who loves hiding in the shadows. Each page is filled with hidden cats waiting to be discovered as you follow the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/d165b811af9e6e52b948dceb713930ad.poster.avif?t=1787941221\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/d165b811af9e6e52b948dceb713930ad.webm?t=1787941221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/d165b811af9e6e52b948dceb713930ad.mp4?t=1787941221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 5 pages comic and jigsaw Puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😻 200++ cats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📷 Photo mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔆 Brightness setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Choose your favorite color</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 4 Musics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔔 Free hints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💾 Save system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔍 Zoom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔉 Cute cat sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Gamepad compatible</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/11982d56fbe25e12e0f879816de4fc3c.poster.avif?t=1787941221\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/11982d56fbe25e12e0f879816de4fc3c.webm?t=1787941221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/11982d56fbe25e12e0f879816de4fc3c.mp4?t=1787941221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/29e053ba99a02ec2f368941474dbffdf.poster.avif?t=1787941221\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/29e053ba99a02ec2f368941474dbffdf.webm?t=1787941221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/29e053ba99a02ec2f368941474dbffdf.mp4?t=1787941221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/4384b063286becaf5e54526f9b508999.avif?t=1787941221\" width=616 height=91 /></span></p>",
