><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📷 Photo mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔆 Brightness setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Choose your favorite color</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 4 Musics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔔 Free hints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💾 Save system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔍 Zoom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔉 Cute cat sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Gamepad compatible</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/11982d56fbe25e12e0f879816de4fc3c.poster.avif?t=1787941221\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/11982d56fbe25e12e0f879816de4fc3c.webm?t=1787941221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/11982d56fbe25e12e0f879816de4fc3c.mp4?t=1787941221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/29e053ba99a02ec2f368941474dbffdf.poster.avif?t=1787941221\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/29e053ba99a02ec2f368941474dbffdf.webm?t=1787941221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/29e053ba99a02ec2f368941474dbffdf.mp4?t=1787941221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426090/extras/4